<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak July real retail sales rise 5.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak July real retail sales rise 5.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak July retail sales, in real terms, rose 5.5 percent after a 3.4 percent fall in June, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SUSR said retail sales for the first seven months of 1996 totalled 162.6 billion crowns, an increase of 7.3 percent over the same month last year.</p>
<p> SLOVAK RETAIL SALES   July'96  June'96  July'95  Jan-July'96</p>
<p>  real pct change yr/yr  +5.5     -3.4     +2.9	+7.3</p>
<p>--Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
